          "sha256": "b8c6684408f0b606d270ea21852dced19de3625e22a724fcb0ead80727d0f9f7",
          "title": "Unearned Revenue"
        },
        {
          "interpretation": "Prior segment amounts were recast for internal management reporting. The segment revenue table reconciles to consolidated total revenue for both years.",
